    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Line. Command the Fight. Survive the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient horrors have risen from the depths, threatening to destroy what\u2019s left of civilization. As a mercenary commander, your mission is simple: <strong>defend the arenas</strong> and stop the monstrous hordes \u2014 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you\u2019ll place your squad. Once combat begins, there\u2019s no turning back. <strong>No mid-fight commands. No second chances.</strong><br>Success depends entirely on <strong>how well you plan and position your units.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come in many forms: melee brutes, ranged attackers, explosive beasts, healers, and even summoners that spawn new threats mid-battle.<br>Every encounter is a test of wits, not reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical placement-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No active control during battle \u2014 planning is everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish visuals and intense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of arenas, each like a deadly puzzle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outthink the darkness \u2014 or will your strategy fall apart?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Line. Command the Fight. Survive the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient horrors have risen from the depths, threatening to destroy what\u2019s left of civilization. As a mercenary commander, your mission is simple: <strong>defend the arenas</strong> and stop the monstrous hordes \u2014 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you\u2019ll place your squad. Once combat begins, there\u2019s no turning back. <strong>No mid-fight commands. No second chances.</strong><br>Success depends entirely on <strong>how well you plan and position your units.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come in many forms: melee brutes, ranged attackers, explosive beasts, healers, and even summoners that spawn new threats mid-battle.<br>Every encounter is a test of wits, not reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical placement-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No active control during battle \u2014 planning is everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish visuals and intense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of arenas, each like a deadly puzzle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outthink the darkness \u2014 or will your strategy fall apart?</p>",
